# pi-web-factory (M-068): keep local dev artifacts and accumulated runtime
# state out of the build context. node_modules is reinstalled at build time
# (bun.lock, --frozen-lockfile) for a reproducible image; factory.db* is the
# trace database, real accumulated observability history that must never be
# baked into an image layer (see cli.ts's PI_WEB_FACTORY_DB_PATH doc comment
# for why the running container points it elsewhere entirely).
pi-web-factory/node_modules
pi-web-factory/factory.db
pi-web-factory/factory.db-shm
pi-web-factory/factory.db-wal
pi-web-factory/visualizer/node_modules
pi-web-factory/visualizer/dist
